00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:55.150
The trick, having a frozen
header and a frozen footer--

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:55.780
Yeah.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.790
--is to make multiple tables--

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.260
three tables, to be exact.

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.268
It sounds nuts.

00:08:00.268 --> 00:08:01.810
But that's the only
way you can do it

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:04.700
because every other way
is prone to failure.

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:07.120
So these are multiple tables?

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:11.800
Yes, sort of globbed
together with HTML tools.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.730
So there's a div here.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:16.630
There's a div here,
another div, another div.

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:19.390
So it's three divs within a div.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.830
But yeah, this middle div
is basically the body.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.650
And I've hidden the home labels.

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:24.760
You can totally do that.

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:25.900
[INAUDIBLE] isn't it?

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.275
Another option is
to have options

00:08:27.275 --> 00:08:29.587
just like call
labels hidden, true,

00:08:29.587 --> 00:08:30.670
and then it's [INAUDIBLE].

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:32.530
The only major thing
you have to do,

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.480
and this is super,
super important, is you

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:38.238
have to set the widths of each
column in each of these tables.

00:08:38.238 --> 00:08:39.280
Otherwise, it just fails.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:42.460
You just get misaligned
stuff, and it'll just

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:46.360
